fill=\"white\"/><text x=\"360.0\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\">30-Day Readmission Target Distribution</text><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"350\" stroke=\"#444\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"350\" x2=\"690\" y2=\"350\" stroke=\"#444\"/><rect x=\"172.5\" y=\"65.0\" width=\"165.0\" height=\"285.0\" fill=\"#5b9bd5\"/><text x=\"255.0\" y=\"58.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\">90,409</text><text x=\"255.0\" y=\"375\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\">No 30-day readmission</text><rect x=\"472.5\" y=\"314.2\" width=\"165.0\" height=\"35.8\" fill=\"#5b9bd5\"/><text x=\"555.0\" y=\"307.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\">11,357</text><text x=\"555.0\" y=\"375\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\">Readmitted &lt;30 days</text><text x=\"360.0\" y=\"402\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\">Target</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"210.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 18 210.0)\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\">Patients</text></svg>","text/plain":["<Figure>"]},"metadata":{}}],"source":["data[\"target_30day\"] = (data[\"readmitted\"] == \"<30\").astype(int)\n","\n","plt.figure(figsize=(8,5))\n","sns.countplot(data=data, x=\"target_30day\")\n","plt.title(\"30-Day Readmission Target Distribution\")\n","plt.xlabel(\"Target (0 = No, 1 = Readmitted <30 Days)\")\n","plt.ylabel(\"Number of Patients\")\n","plt.show()"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["3. Splitting and Scaling"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":5,"metadata":{},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Training samples: 81412\n","Testing samples: 20354\n","Features retained: 41\n"]}],"source":["from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n","from sklearn.compose import ColumnTransformer\n","from sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\n","from sklearn.impute import SimpleImputer\n","from sklearn.preprocessing import OneHotEncoder, StandardScaler\n","\n","drop_cols = [\"encounter_id\", \"patient_nbr\", \"readmitted\", \"target_30day\"]\n","X = data.drop(columns=drop_cols)\n","y = data[\"target_30day\"]\n","\n","# Remove features with more than 90% missing values\n","high_missing = X.columns[X.isna().mean() > 0.90]\n","X = X.drop(columns=high_missing)\n","\n","X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(\n","    X, y, test_size=0.20, random_state=42, stratify=y\n",")\n","\n","numeric = X_train.select_dtypes(include=np.number).columns\n","categorical = X_train.select_dtypes(exclude=np.number).columns\n","\n","numeric_pipe = Pipeline([\n","    (\"imputer\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\")),\n","    (\"scaler\", StandardScaler())\n,"])\n","\n","categorical_pipe = Pipeline([\n","    (\"imputer\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"most_frequent\")),\n","    (\"onehot\", OneHotEncoder(handle_unknown=\"ignore\"))\n,"])\n","\n","preprocess = ColumnTransformer([\n","    (\"num\", numeric_pipe, numeric),\n","    (\"cat\", categorical_pipe, categorical)\n,"])\n","\n","print(\"Training samples:\", X_train.shape[0])\n","print(\"Testing samples:\", X_test.shape[0])\n","print(\"Features retained:\", X.shape[1])"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["4. Training and Evaluating Model"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":6,"metadata":{},"outputs":[{"output_type":"execute_result","execution_count":6,"data":{"text/plain":["Pipeline(steps=[('preprocess', ColumnTransformer(...)), ('logreg', LogisticRegression(...))])"]},"metadata":{}}],"source":["from sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\n","\n","model = Pipeline([\n","    (\"preprocess\", preprocess),\n","    (\"logreg\", LogisticRegression(\n","        penalty=\"l2\",\n","        C=1.0,\n","        max_iter=1000,\n","        solver=\"liblinear\"\n","    ))\n,"])\n","\n","model.fit(X_train, y_train)\n","y_prob = model.predict_proba(X_test)[:, 1]\n","y_pred = (y_prob >= 0.50).astype(int)"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":7,"metadata":{},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["ROC_AUC_SCORE : 0.6462317831717455\n","Confusion Matrix :\n [[18039    44]\n [ 2229    42]]\n","Classification Report :\n               precision    recall  f1-score   support\n\n           0     0.8900    0.9976    0.9407     18083\n           1     0.4884    0.0185    0.0356      2271\n\n    accuracy                         0.8883     20354\n   macro avg     0.6892    0.5080    0.4882     20354\nweighted avg     0.8452    0.8883    0.8397     20354\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"image/svg+xml":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"420\" height=\"390\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 390\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"white\"/><text x=\"210.0\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\">Confusion Matrix</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"90\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" fill=\"rgb(125,125,125)\" stroke=\"#666\"/><text x=\"160.0\" y=\"147.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"20\">18039</text><rect x=\"210\" y=\"90\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" fill=\"rgb(245,245,245)\" stroke=\"#666\"/><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"147.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"20\">44</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"190\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" fill=\"rgb(230,230,230)\" stroke=\"#666\"/><text x=\"160.0\" y=\"247.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"20\">2229</text><rect x=\"210\" y=\"190\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" fill=\"rgb(245,245,245)\" stroke=\"#666\"/><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"247.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"20\">42</text><text x=\"160.0\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\">Predicted 0</text><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\">Predicted 1</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"140.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 60 140.0)\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"12\">Actual 0 / 1</text></svg>","text/plain":["<Figure>"]},"metadata":{}}],"source":["from sklearn.metrics import roc_auc_score, classification_report, confusion_matrix\n","\n","roc_auc = roc_auc_score(y_test, y_prob)\n","cm = confusion_matrix(y_test, y_pred)\n","\n","print(\"ROC_AUC_SCORE :\", roc_auc)\n","print(\"Confusion Matrix :\\n\", cm)\n","print(\"Classification Report :\\n\", classification_report(y_test, y_pred, digits=4))"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["5. False Negative vs False Positive Cost"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["A **false negative** is a patient who is actually readmitted within 30 days but is not flagged by the model. In this case, the test set contains **2,229 false negatives**, representing missed high-risk cases.\n\n","A **false positive** is a patient flagged as high-risk who is not readmitted. There are **44 false positives**, which can create additional follow-up workload.\n\n","For a clinical screening setting, the relative cost of these two error types should be considered when choosing the decision threshold. This notebook is an educational case study and is not a clinical decision-support system."]}]}